      "id": "4a991455-07b2-4ec6-81ee-7aeac9d1bbd0",
      "name": "Extract fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.html",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2340,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b1480f47-aee0-4174-b182-c81d11fc3fb0",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.sla || '').trim() === 'Overdue' && $('Config').first().json.ownerList.includes(($json.owner || '').trim()) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "002d504d-64a0-4401-8d48-afd1cb13c8d5",
      "name": "Keep overdue for owners",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        2550,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Build the 5 table columns. Ticket cell is a HYPERLINK formula so it stays clickable.\n// Output keys must match the table headers exactly.\nreturn $input.all().map((item) => {\n  const j = item.json;\n  const url = String(j.url ?? '').replace(/\"/g, '\"\"'); // escape quotes for the formula\n  const ticket = String(j.ticket ?? '').trim();\n  return {\n    json: {\n      'Overdue Tickets': `=HYPERLINK(\"${url}\",\"${ticket}\")`,\n      'Severity': String(j.severity ?? '').trim(),\n      'Assignment': String(j.owner ?? '').trim(),\n      'State': String(j.state ?? '').trim(),\n      'Summary': '',\n    },\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "b326222c-b73e-4274-8774-ab0cf67752e8",
      "name": "Build rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2760,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.graphBase }}/sites/{{ $('Config').first().json.dstSiteId }}/drive/items/{{ $('Config').first().json.dstItemId }}/workbook/tables('{{ $('Config').first().json.dstTable }}')/rows",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"values\": [[ $json['Overdue Tickets'], $json['Severity'], $json['Assignment'], $json['State'], $json['Summary'] ]] } }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "oAuth2Api",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1e37574-f436-4693-8b02-8bc889bdbe7d",
      "name": "Append to table",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2970,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup after import\n\n**1) One credential for the 5 HTTP nodes**\nCreate an **OAuth2 API** credential:\n- Grant Type: **Client Credentials**\n- Access Token URL: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/<TENANT_ID>/oauth2/v2.0/token`\n- Client ID / Secret: from your Entra app registration\n- Scope: `https://graph.microsoft.com/.default`\n\nAttach it to: List folder, Get table range, Clear table rows, Download file, Append to table.\nThe app needs Graph **application** permission **Sites.Selected**, authorized on both the ServiceFabric and IPEngineering sites.\n\n**2) Fill the Config node**\n- `srcSiteId` / `dstSiteId` \u2014 Graph Explorer: `GET /sites/digitalrealty.sharepoint.com:/sites/ServiceFabric?$select=id` (and `.../IPEngineering`)\n- `srcFolderPath` \u2014 source folder name (default document library assumed)\n- `dstItemId` \u2014 workbook driveItem id: `GET /sites/{dstSiteId}/drive/root/search(q='Network Engineering Overdue Tickets')?$select=id,name`\n- `dstSheet` / `dstTable` \u2014 worksheet name + table name (the Table Design tab shows the table name)\n- `ownerList` \u2014 already set to your 5 owners\n\n**Notes**\n- Filter = SLA `Overdue` AND owner in list \u2014 all severities, no group gate.\n- Tickets are written as `=HYPERLINK(...)` so they stay clickable. If they land as literal text, write the range `formulas` instead.\n- \"Clear table rows\" empties the table body each run so closed tickets drop out (full sync). It continues on error for the already-empty case.\n- \"Extract fields\" selectors assume the current column order of the dashboard; update the nth-child numbers if that layout changes.\n",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b423f590-950b-4261-b4cc-ca4e035279d0",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        560
      ]
    }
  ],
